  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1231033,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st One: A Commodore 64 Football Management Masterpiece\n\nTake charge of your dream football club in *1st One*, a thrilling and addictive management simulation for the Commodore 64!  Choose from any of the top four English leagues and guide your team to glory.  More than just kicking a ball, *1st One* plunges you into the complete managerial experience.\n\nScout for promising young talent, strategically build your squad, and meticulously plan training regimes to hone your players' skills.  Tactical decisions are key – adjust your formation and player roles to outwit your opponents on the pitch.  But victory isn’t guaranteed; injuries, financial pressures, and the unpredictable nature of football will constantly test your resolve.\n\nAfter each match, receive detailed reports on player fitness, crucial league updates, and your club's finances.  Can you balance the books while building a championship-winning team?  *1st One* offers deep strategic gameplay, authentic football atmosphere, and addictive replayability – the ultimate test of your managerial prowess!"
    },
